# Every city's landmark model in one scope: the app's landmark model
# (src/src/trilogyModels.ts), which queries across cities.
#
# Not a refresh entrypoint. `trilogy refresh <file>` builds what the file
# declares and this one declares nothing, so refreshing it probes every city
# and builds none. Each city's parquet is built by its own
# `refresh-landmarks-{code}` job from `raw/{code}/{slug}_landmarks.preql`; see
# "Building" in docs/LANDMARKS.md.

